    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>A Simple Job</strong> \u2013 A game that slowly drives you insane... for free! \ud83c\udf00</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new dream job! Your task? Super simple:<br><strong>Just don\u2019t press the red button.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy, right? \ud83d\ude07 Well... it <i>would be</i> if it weren\u2019t for that <strong>annoying voice</strong> constantly yapping in your ear.<br>Imagine Clippy from the 2000s had too much coffee, a podcast mic, and zero chill. \ud83c\udfa4\ud83d\ude35</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many ridiculous ways this \u201csimple\u201d game can end \u2014 there are more endings than you\u2019ll have reasons to <i>distrust that button.</i> \ud83d\udca3</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 One (suspiciously good-looking) red button that can ruin everything<br>\ud83e\udde0 Multiple endings, ranging from \u201cmeh\u201d to \u201cWHAT JUST HAPPENED?!\u201d<br>\ud83e\udd47 A small but <i>mighty</i> list of achievements \u2014 <strong>more coming if people like it!</strong><br>\ud83d\ude35 A narrator voice you\u2019ll regret meeting (and it regrets you too)<br>\ud83d\udcb8 100% free (because even we know this got out of hand)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So... do you accept the job?<br>\ud83d\udd15 Don\u2019t press the button.<br>\ud83d\udd14 Or... maybe do? \ud83d\udc40<br>(And if you like it, we\u2019ll make it even worse. Promise.) \ud83d\ude08</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>A Simple Job</strong> \u2013 A game that slowly drives you insane... for free! \ud83c\udf00</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new dream job! Your task? Super simple:<br><strong>Just don\u2019t press the red button.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy, right? \ud83d\ude07 Well... it <i>would be</i> if it weren\u2019t for that <strong>annoying voice</strong> constantly yapping in your ear.<br>Imagine Clippy from the 2000s had too much coffee, a podcast mic, and zero chill. \ud83c\udfa4\ud83d\ude35</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many ridiculous ways this \u201csimple\u201d game can end \u2014 there are more endings than you\u2019ll have reasons to <i>distrust that button.</i> \ud83d\udca3</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 One (suspiciously good-looking) red button that can ruin everything<br>\ud83e\udde0 Multiple endings, ranging from \u201cmeh\u201d to \u201cWHAT JUST HAPPENED?!\u201d<br>\ud83e\udd47 A small but <i>mighty</i> list of achievements \u2014 <strong>more coming if people like it!</strong><br>\ud83d\ude35 A narrator voice you\u2019ll regret meeting (and it regrets you too)<br>\ud83d\udcb8 100% free (because even we know this got out of hand)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So... do you accept the job?<br>\ud83d\udd15 Don\u2019t press the button.<br>\ud83d\udd14 Or... maybe do? \ud83d\udc40<br>(And if you like it, we\u2019ll make it even worse. Promise.) \ud83d\ude08</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udcbc A simple task: Don\u2019t press the red button. Sounds easy? \ud83d\ude0f Featuring an annoying voice, absurd endings, and too many achievements. Free. Pointless. Glorious. \ud83e\udd21\ud83d\udd34",
